abstract: "Versioned, source-bound public research records. v0.5.0 adds: Published Qwen2.5-1.5B Core ML package against an fp32 reference of its original weights: the GPU output follows the reference for 7 tokens, the ANE output differs from the first token, and cpuOnly returns NaN. Scope: one Mac, the same chip, one published package, one prompt, compared with an fp32 CPU reference of the original weights. ANE execution is inferred from Core ML compute-plan placement. The cause of the differences is unknown, and the reference is not checked against PyTorch or transformers. No novelty claim."
